    "article_paragraphs": [
      {
        "number": 1,
        "text": "Lily and Tom play a game. They are in the living room. \"Point to your nose!\" says Tom. Lily points. \"Point to your head!\" Lily points to her head. \"Good!\" says Tom."
      },
      {
        "number": 2,
        "text": "\"Clap your hands!\" says Lily. Tom claps his hands. Tom has brown hair. \"Look at my face!\" says Lily. \"I have two eyes.\" \"I have two ears.\" \"I have a mouth.\""
      },
      {
        "number": 3,
        "text": "Pip looks. \"Woof!\" says Pip. Lily has two arms. She has two legs. \"Pip has four legs!\" says Tom. \"He has two ears.\" \"Is his nose black?\" asks Lily. \"Yes, it is!\" Lily smiles. They are happy."
      }
